Description: YUME stable C ABI runtime library
 YUME tunnels application streams through an authenticated TLS 1.3 carrier
 that can use an HTTP/2 camouflage preface.
 .
 This package contains libyume, a small stable C ABI exposing YUME build,
 version, feature, and backend information for external tools and future
 integrations. The high-level client/server C++ implementation remains
 private to the YUME binaries.

